window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"graves","b":"masteryi","win":["Graves","Graves","Graves","Skill","Master Yi","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Levels 1-3","text":"Pellets, End of the Line and the smoke slow rule — chunk him every wave."},{"when":"Enemy level 6","text":"Highlander is slow-immune, so smoke only cuts his sight, never his speed."},{"when":"First item","text":"Clean E-reload kiting can still win — a piloting check, not a stat check."},{"when":"2+ items","text":"His crit duels beat yours — group, smoke his sight mid-dive, burst as a team."}],"wants":{"you":["A snowballed 1-3 bully phase","Punishing his Alpha Strike landing","Kiting with Quickdraw plus reload autos"],"foe":["Lifesteal through your early poke","Post-6 all-ins that stick to you","Late straight crit duels"]},"early":"You dominate the opening: double-shell autos, Buckshot bursts, and Quickdraw's armor grit win levels 1-3 outright, and Smoke Screen shuts off any all-in he tries. Chunk him every wave and take plates — build the lead while his lifesteal is weak, because from 4-5 it starts eating your poke and the free trades disappear.","mid":"His 6 is the warning bell — Highlander sticks through your kiting and Meditate stalls your burst, so fights become piloting checks. You can still win at first item with clean play: blind the Alpha Strike return window, Quickdraw away, reload autos on the move. Sloppy trades die here; disciplined kiting keeps the lane even and the gold flowing.","late":"Two-plus items he wins straight duels, so stop offering them. Group with your team and hold Smoke Screen for the instant he dives your carry — a blinded Yi mid-Highlander is a dead Yi — then burst him inside the CC. Wall-bounced Buckshots and grass resets keep you slippery; alone in a side lane you are just his snack, so never be there.","whys":["Level 1 is Graves — double-shell autos out-damage anything he can do.","Level 2 stays yours: point-blank pellets plus True Grit stacks win the short trades.","Level 3 is Graves — Smoke Screen's slow and sight cut break any all-in he starts.","Levels 4-5 even out as his lifesteal offsets your poke — a real skill window.","Level 6 is Yi's: Highlander makes him immune to slows, so Smoke Screen stops holding him off you.","First item is skill-dependent — your dash and reload kiting can still beat him if you pilot it cleanly.","2+ items is Yi's — crit scaling wins straight duels, so your answer is teamfights, not side lanes."]});
